{"file":"Agile Merge Review-1.16.0-v2.zip","bytes":62025,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"agile-merge-review","displayName":"Agile Merge Review","description":"Merge-review skills for Claude Code — deep PR review, fix-until-satisfied, rebase with conflict resolution, structured Jira postmortems, and multi-PR merge train. Needs the gh CLI. (Formerly dev-skills.)","version":"1.16.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","homepage":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","keywords":["agile","review","github","jira"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"agile-merge-review","description":"Review, fix, verify, merge, and close out open pull requests in Jira.","version":"1.16.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","homepage":"https://github.com/cedricfarinazzo/agile-skills","keywords":["agile","review","github","jira"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/agile-11-merge-train/SKILL.md","name":"agile-11-merge-train","description":"Process every open PR sequentially: rebase → deep review → fix → fresh CI → merge → Jira postmortem + Done. Block PRs too broken to fix in one pass. Triggers: merge train, process all open prs, /merge-train.","headings":["agile_11_merge_train","Dispatch-and-verify","Codex adapter","Configuration","Input","Phase 0 — Gather","Phase 1 — Detect cross-PR conflicts","Phase 2 — Determine merge order","Phase 3 — Process each PR sequentially","3a. Always rebase on latest main","3b. Deep review — this is the main work","3c. Fix until satisfied — invoked on every PR, clean reviews included","3d. Bad-PR escape hatch","3e. Wait for **fresh** CI green","BEFORE the push:","AFTER the push — resolve the NEW id, then poll that id only:","3f. Merge","3g. Postmortem + Jira state"],"name_hint":"agile · 11 · 合并 · train","description_zh":"顺序处理全部未关闭 PR，执行分支更新、深入审核、修复、新 CI、合并及 Jira 复盘；单轮无法修复的 PR 标为阻塞。"},{"path":"skills/merge-fix-until-satisfied/SKILL.md","name":"merge-fix-until-satisfied","description":"Fix every PR review issue, commit, push, re-check until satisfied. Triggers: fix all, fix everything, /fix-until-satisfied. After merge-review-pr.","headings":["merge-fix-until-satisfied","Phase 1 — Fix","Phase 2 — Commit & push","Phase 3 — Re-examine","Phase 4 — Verdict"],"name_hint":"合并 · 修复 · until · satisfied","description_zh":"修复 PR 审核发现的全部问题，提交、推送并重新检查，循环至满足要求；用于深入审核之后。"},{"path":"skills/merge-jira-postmortem/SKILL.md","name":"merge-jira-postmortem","description":"Post structured post-merge comment to Jira ticket + transition to Done (skip transition in blocked mode). Mandatory even on 0-issue PRs. Triggers: jira postmortem, comment jira, /jira-postmortem.","headings":["merge-jira-postmortem","Input","Steps","Comment structure","Post-merge review findings — what was wrong","<IDX>. <Severity>: <short title>","What was correct","Conscious accepts (if any)","Cross-PR conflicts (if any)","PR blocked — not merged","Missing / wrong","What was correct","Path forward","Boundaries"],"name_hint":"合并 · jira · postmortem","description_zh":"向 Jira 工单发布结构化合并后复盘并转为 Done；阻塞模式下跳过状态转换，即使 PR 无问题也记录复盘。"},{"path":"skills/merge-review-pr/SKILL.md","name":"merge-review-pr","description":"Deep PR review: read every changed file in full, check correctness/security/naming/tests/docs/ACs. Report by severity. Triggers: review pr, /review-pr. Use instead of /review for file-level depth.","headings":["merge-review-pr","Input","Steps","Review lenses (check all)","Output format","PR #<N> Review — [title]","Files read in full","Lens verdicts (one line per lens — cite or N/A)","AC verification (every AC → the line that satisfies it)","Critical","Minor","Severity calls"],"name_hint":"合并 · 评审 · pr","description_zh":"逐个完整阅读 PR 变更文件，深入检查正确性、安全、命名、测试、文档和验收标准，按严重程度报告。"},{"path":"skills/merge-update-pr/SKILL.md","name":"merge-update-pr","description":"Rebase PR branch on main: merge --no-ff, resolve conflicts intelligently, lint-after-rebase gate, push only if merge commit created. Triggers: update pr, merge main into, /update-pr.","headings":["merge-update-pr","Steps","No-op merge (branch already on top of main)","Report exactly one outcome"],"name_hint":"合并 · 更新 · pr","description_zh":"将 main 更新合入 PR 分支并解决冲突，运行合入后的 lint 门禁；原文具体使用 merge --no-ff，仅产生合并提交时推送。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["<img src=\".claude-plugin/icon.svg\" width=\"40\" alt=\"\" align=\"top\"> agile-merge-review","Install","What's in it","Dispatch-and-verify — no shortcuts","The per-PR sequence","Independent review — the second of three layers","Configuration","Where it fits"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/icon.svg",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".codex-plugin/plugin.json","README.md","agents/fix-until-satisfied.md","agents/jira-postmortem.md","agents/pr-reviewer.md","agents/pr-updater.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/.gitignore","evals-fix-until-satisfied/01-cleanup-threshold/graders/outcome.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/01-cleanup-threshold/graders/skill-fired.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/01-cleanup-threshold/prompt.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/02-wrong-branch-blocked/graders/outcome.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/02-wrong-branch-blocked/graders/skill-fired.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/02-wrong-branch-blocked/prompt.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/03-neg/graders/no-skill.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/03-neg/graders/outcome.md","evals-fix-until-satisfied/03-neg/prompt.md","evals-jira-postmortem/.gitignore","evals-jira-postmortem/01-clean-pr-mandatory/graders/outcome.md","evals-jira-postmortem/01-clean-pr-mandatory/graders/skill-fired.md","evals-jira-postmortem/01-clean-pr-mandatory/prompt.md","evals-jira-postmortem/02-collisions-echoed/graders/outcome.md","evals-jira-postmortem/02-collisions-echoed/graders/skill-fired.md","evals-jira-postmortem/02-collisions-echoed/prompt.md","evals-jira-postmortem/03-neg/graders/no-skill.md","evals-jira-postmortem/03-neg/graders/outc